  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "你知道 AI 智能体记得越多，为什么反而可能越笨吗？先想一想。",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 5.304,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.168,
      "spokenEnd": 4.654,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Microsoft Research 指出，长交互历史会把有用经验和无关细节混在一起。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.256,
      "audioStart": 4.658,
      "spokenStart": 4.814,
      "spokenEnd": 9.272,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "智能体每次都从更大的材料堆里找答案，上下文被噪声占满，真正会改变下一步的约束反而更难被找到。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.512,
      "audioStart": 9.266,
      "spokenStart": 9.432,
      "spokenEnd": 16.146,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这一期给你一张 AI 智能体保留、提炼、遗忘表：判断什么该继续可用，什么要压缩成经验，什么不该再抢占注意力。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.64,
      "audioStart": 16.144,
      "spokenStart": 16.306,
      "spokenEnd": 24.138,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "目标不是让智能体拥有完美记忆，而是拥有能支持当前决策的最小有效记忆；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.64,
      "audioStart": 24.135,
      "spokenStart": 24.298,
      "spokenEnd": 29.128,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "每次检索都要配得上当前任务。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 29.062,
      "spokenStart": 29.228,
      "spokenEnd": 31.163,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 31.166,
      "spokenStart": 31.323,
      "spokenEnd": 37.095,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 2 章：原始历史。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.16,
      "audioStart": 37.121,
      "spokenStart": 37.275,
      "spokenEnd": 38.637,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "先分清完整日志和有用记忆不是同一件事。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.744,
      "audioStart": 38.576,
      "spokenStart": 38.737,
      "spokenEnd": 41.694,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "一次交互记录里，可能同时有决策、失败搜索、复制材料、过期计划和临时工具报错。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.456,
      "audioStart": 41.69,
      "spokenStart": 41.854,
      "spokenEnd": 47.5,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "保留原记录，对追溯和恢复很重要；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.976,
      "audioStart": 47.494,
      "spokenStart": 47.66,
      "spokenEnd": 49.828,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "但把整段记录送回每一个新任务，是另一种完全不同的选择。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.632,
      "audioStart": 49.762,
      "spokenStart": 49.928,
      "spokenEnd": 53.753,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "检索到的无关细节越多，智能体越难找到真正会改变当前判断的条件。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.328,
      "audioStart": 53.761,
      "spokenStart": 53.913,
      "spokenEnd": 58.456,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "所以更多记忆可能看似提高了回忆量，却让推理更慢、更不可靠。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.16,
      "audioStart": 58.464,
      "spokenStart": 58.616,
      "spokenEnd": 62.996,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "更危险的是，智能体会把一条过期细节和一条关键约束放在同一层级，无法主动判断谁该优先进入当前窗口。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 8.544,
      "audioStart": 62.935,
      "spokenStart": 63.096,
      "spokenEnd": 70.836,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把历史当成需要加工的来源，而不是必须整桶倒进上下文的材料。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.848,
      "audioStart": 70.83,
      "spokenStart": 70.996,
      "spokenEnd": 75.037,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 75.043,
      "spokenStart": 75.197,
      "spokenEnd": 75.868,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，原始历史用于追溯，不等于默认提示词。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.864,
      "audioStart": 75.813,
      "spokenStart": 75.968,
      "spokenEnd": 79.033,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，先区分保存事件和当前检索事件的价值。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.104,
      "audioStart": 79.038,
      "spokenStart": 79.193,
      "spokenEnd": 82.503,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用是否改善下一步决策来衡量记忆。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.696,
      "audioStart": 82.503,
      "spokenStart": 82.663,
      "spokenEnd": 85.568,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 3 章：有用单元。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.112,
      "audioStart": 85.596,
      "spokenStart": 85.748,
      "spokenEnd": 87.085,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "把经验转成 AI 智能体真正能复用的东西。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.384,
      "audioStart": 87.019,
      "spokenStart": 87.185,
      "spokenEnd": 89.763,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "原文描述了一种转变：不只保存文本片段，而是保存结构化知识。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.04,
      "audioStart": 89.76,
      "spokenStart": 89.923,
      "spokenEnd": 94.156,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "一类单元是事实，例如已经核实的约束、当前设置，或能缩小安全操作范围的结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.216,
      "audioStart": 94.156,
      "spokenStart": 94.316,
      "spokenEnd": 99.749,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "另一类单元是可复用技能：什么时候行动、要收集什么证据、何时停止的紧凑步骤。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.144,
      "audioStart": 99.744,
      "spokenStart": 99.909,
      "spokenEnd": 105.254,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "事实回答当前任务里什么足够可信；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.192,
      "audioStart": 105.258,
      "spokenStart": 105.414,
      "spokenEnd": 107.809,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "技能回答下次遇到同类模式时怎样推进。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.528,
      "audioStart": 107.757,
      "spokenStart": 107.909,
      "spokenEnd": 110.644,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u03",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "两者都应带着来源或触发条件，避免把一次碰巧成功的做法误写成任何环境都适用的规则。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 110.578,
      "spokenStart": 110.744,
      "spokenEnd": 116.506,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这样可以去掉重复叙述，却不丢失交互中真正有价值的经验。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 116.501,
      "spokenStart": 116.666,
      "spokenEnd": 120.435,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 120.441,
      "spokenStart": 120.595,
      "spokenEnd": 121.267,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，把已核实事实从原始记录中提取出来。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.768,
      "audioStart": 121.213,
      "spokenStart": 121.367,
      "spokenEnd": 124.344,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，把可重复的过程写成技能，而不是保存故事。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.96,
      "audioStart": 124.346,
      "spokenStart": 124.504,
      "spokenEnd": 127.664,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，让每个单元只服务一个未来判断。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 127.667,
      "spokenStart": 127.824,
      "spokenEnd": 130.316,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 4 章：任务路由。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.016,
      "audioStart": 130.337,
      "spokenStart": 130.496,
      "spokenEnd": 131.712,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "只检索属于当前任务的知识。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.52,
      "audioStart": 131.652,
      "spokenStart": 131.812,
      "spokenEnd": 133.53,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "PlugMem 用高层概念和推断出的意图做路由信号，而不是默认返还很长的原文段落。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 133.536,
      "spokenStart": 133.69,
      "spokenEnd": 139.446,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "实际操作时，先写清当前目标、对象、风险和下一步需要什么支持。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.736,
      "audioStart": 139.449,
      "spokenStart": 139.606,
      "spokenEnd": 144.561,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "再用这些线索挑选少量事实和技能，不要因为共享一个宽泛关键词就拿回全部记录。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.456,
      "audioStart": 144.572,
      "spokenStart": 144.721,
      "spokenEnd": 150.388,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "选中的记忆进入基础智能体前，还要压缩成行动指引：已知什么、什么重要、还要核对什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.152,
      "audioStart": 150.393,
      "spokenStart": 150.548,
      "spokenEnd": 156.897,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这样即使模型切换、窗口变短，下一步也能从同一份明确的决策依据继续。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.76,
      "audioStart": 156.835,
      "spokenStart": 156.997,
      "spokenEnd": 161.969,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果答案依赖实时变化的信息，检索旧记忆仍然不够，必须补充当前来源的证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.832,
      "audioStart": 161.965,
      "spokenStart": 162.129,
      "spokenEnd": 167.153,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 167.159,
      "spokenStart": 167.313,
      "spokenEnd": 167.984,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，从当前决策路由，不从模糊话题路由。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.672,
      "audioStart": 167.923,
      "spokenStart": 168.084,
      "spokenEnd": 170.949,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，交给智能体的是行动指引，不是整段聊天记录。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.392,
      "audioStart": 170.947,
      "spokenStart": 171.109,
      "spokenEnd": 174.689,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，变化中的事实必须补充新证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.432,
      "audioStart": 174.689,
      "spokenStart": 174.849,
      "spokenEnd": 177.485,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 5 章：记忆周期。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.04,
      "audioStart": 177.505,
      "spokenStart": 177.665,
      "spokenEnd": 178.907,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "决定每条内容是保留、压缩，还是退出工作记忆。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.936,
      "audioStart": 178.85,
      "spokenStart": 179.007,
      "spokenEnd": 182.154,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当一条内容已核实、很可能影响以后决策，并且有清晰检索线索时，应该保留。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6,
      "audioStart": 182.157,
      "spokenStart": 182.314,
      "spokenEnd": 187.528,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当一次事件很长，但经验能变成事实、规则、检查清单或交接笔记时，应该提炼。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.792,
      "audioStart": 187.528,
      "spokenStart": 187.688,
      "spokenEnd": 193.68,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当内容过期、重复、置信度低，或只适合审计而不适合行动时，应退出主动检索。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.696,
      "audioStart": 193.679,
      "spokenStart": 193.84,
      "spokenEnd": 199.735,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "退出工作记忆不等于删除证据；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 199.74,
      "spokenStart": 199.895,
      "spokenEnd": 201.828,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "治理和排障需要时，原始轨迹仍应可查。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 201.765,
      "spokenStart": 201.928,
      "spokenEnd": 204.679,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u03",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "真正要避免的是旧材料在没有任务价值时不断被召回，并让新证据失去应有的位置。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.312,
      "audioStart": 204.614,
      "spokenStart": 204.779,
      "spokenEnd": 210.289,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "还要写复查日期，因为曾经正确的政策、工具结果或偏好会随环境变化变得误导人。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 210.295,
      "spokenStart": 210.449,
      "spokenEnd": 216.196,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 216.202,
      "spokenStart": 216.356,
      "spokenEnd": 217.034,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，保留能持续影响决策的可靠事实。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.504,
      "audioStart": 216.979,
      "spokenStart": 217.134,
      "spokenEnd": 219.844,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，把长经验提炼成规则或技能。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 219.846,
      "spokenStart": 220.004,
      "spokenEnd": 222.497,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，让过期和重复内容退出主动检索，但保留审计轨迹。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.92,
      "audioStart": 222.496,
      "spokenStart": 222.657,
      "spokenEnd": 226.786,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第 6 章：记忆表。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 1.896,
      "audioStart": 226.81,
      "spokenStart": 226.966,
      "spokenEnd": 228.064,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "下一次长任务前，用保留、提炼、遗忘表做一次筛选。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 228.005,
      "spokenStart": 228.164,
      "spokenEnd": 231.936,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "每条候选记忆写六个字段：记忆项、下一任务价值、状态、紧凑形式、检索线索和复查日期。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.632,
      "audioStart": 231.934,
      "spokenStart": 232.096,
      "spokenEnd": 238.924,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果部署约束改变了权限，就保留这条已核实约束，并写清它影响哪个系统和动作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.312,
      "audioStart": 238.916,
      "spokenStart": 239.084,
      "spokenEnd": 244.603,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果一次排障发现了可重复的修复方式，就提炼成技能：触发条件、步骤、证据和停止条件。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.296,
      "audioStart": 244.599,
      "spokenStart": 244.763,
      "spokenEnd": 251.249,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果五份记录都讲了同一个发现，留下一个可追溯来源，让重复记录退出主动检索。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.528,
      "audioStart": 251.239,
      "spokenStart": 251.409,
      "spokenEnd": 257.124,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "若后来发现结论只适用于某个工具版本，就在同一行补上边界和复查日期，而不是再堆一份相似摘要。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.584,
      "audioStart": 257.058,
      "spokenStart": 257.224,
      "spokenEnd": 263.997,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果你说不出它能改善哪个下一步决策，它大概率不该永久占据智能体的工作记忆。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.024,
      "audioStart": 263.986,
      "spokenStart": 264.157,
      "spokenEnd": 269.359,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 269.365,
      "spokenStart": 269.519,
      "spokenEnd": 270.204,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，保存前先写清它的决策价值。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.072,
      "audioStart": 270.148,
      "spokenStart": 270.304,
      "spokenEnd": 272.591,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，有意识地选择保留、提炼或遗忘。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.456,
      "audioStart": 272.588,
      "spokenStart": 272.751,
      "spokenEnd": 275.399,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，补上检索线索和复查日期，让记忆持续有用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.296,
      "audioStart": 275.399,
      "spokenStart": 275.559,
      "spokenEnd": 279.056,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "AI 智能体不会因为把每条旧消息都带进每个新任务，就自动变得更聪明。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.376,
      "audioStart": 279.069,
      "spokenStart": 279.236,
      "spokenEnd": 283.801,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "原始历史适合追溯；",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.016,
      "audioStart": 283.794,
      "spokenStart": 283.961,
      "spokenEnd": 285.157,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "对行动来说，能够复用的事实和技能往往才是更好的输入。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.608,
      "audioStart": 285.095,
      "spokenStart": 285.257,
      "spokenEnd": 289.059,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "从当前决策开始路由记忆，再把结果压缩到不读完整过去也能看清重点的程度。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.832,
      "audioStart": 289.066,
      "spokenStart": 289.219,
      "spokenEnd": 294.261,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "用保留、提炼、遗忘表把保存、检索和退出变成明确选择，而不是偶然发生。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.384,
      "audioStart": 294.252,
      "spokenStart": 294.421,
      "spokenEnd": 299.992,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "原文的基准结果值得参考，但它更适合推动你检验自己的记忆设计，不是所有智能体都一定提升的保证。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.344,
      "audioStart": 299.987,
      "spokenStart": 300.152,
      "spokenEnd": 306.694,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "关注 Tiny Agent，成为更擅长使用 AI 的人！",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 306.686,
      "spokenStart": 306.854,
      "spokenEnd": 309.355,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    }
